Standing on the shoulders of giants: the ad-blocking technique follows
pixeltris/TwitchAdSolutions (MIT), specifically the vaft script's approach of
swapping the PlaybackAccessToken playerType and stripping stitched ad segments
from the HLS playlist. That repo was archived in March 2026 when its maintainer
stepped away from Twitch. Twitchphage is an independent, leaner reimplementation
— no bundled player, no dependencies, no vendored worker-patching — built to be
maintainable by whoever shows up next. Full respect to pixeltris for mapping the
territory.

